  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "民事財產法",
    "sub_ename": "THE CIVIL PROPERTY LAW",
    "describe_ch": "探討民事上的財產法律關係，以民法總則與債篇通則的相關規範為基礎，課程核心包括法律行為、意思表示，以及債之發生原因的契約、無因管理、不當得利、侵權行為，最後探討以債務不履行規範為主的債之效力相關制度。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is going to discussing the legal issues raising from the dispute about the property between legal subjects on the base of Civil Code, mainly the provisions of General Principles and General Provisions of Obligations. Core of this course includes: Juridical Act, Sources of Obligations, such as Contracts,  Management of Affairs without Mandate, Unjust Enrichment and Torts. In the following comes then Effect of Obligations, including the provisions of debts unfulfilled。",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "暸解民事法律的概括規範。",
      "describe_en": "Overview of the general provisions of civil code"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "掌握民事財產法上的基本概念內涵",
      "describe_en": "Understanding the basic concept of civil law"
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "學習法律規範的體系化",
      "describe_en": "Learning to construct the civil law system"
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "練習法律案例分析",
      "describe_en": "Practicing to analysis the cases in civil law."
    }
  ],
